sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant I as Identity
  participant T as Intake
  participant R as Rate Limit
  participant A as Account
  participant K as Risk
  participant L as Ledger
  participant Q as Kafka
  participant F as Fraud Alert
  participant N as Notification
  C->>G: POST payment with Idempotency-Key
  G->>I: verify session
  G->>T: create payment
  T->>T: idempotency check
  T->>R: Check (gRPC)
  R-->>T: allowed
  T->>I: verify payment PIN
  T->>A: precheck accounts and payee
  T->>K: Evaluate (gRPC)
  K-->>T: score and decision
  alt score below 30
    T->>L: PostJournal (gRPC)
    L-->>T: journal posted
  else score 30 to 59
    T-->>C: one-time password required
  else score 60 to 94
    T->>L: CreateHold (gRPC)
    Note over T,L: held for analyst review
  else score 95 or above
    T-->>C: declined
  end
  T->>Q: txn-events via outbox
  T-->>G: result
  G-->>C: result with checks
  Q->>F: consume event
  F->>N: receipt via Pub/Sub
